      "`DLCDwarvenPuzzleDungeon_CenturionAutumn`, `DLCDwarvenPuzzleDungeon_CenturionFrost`: no other record keeps its own level.",
      "`MS04EncDwarvenCenturionVision` 0C3CB9 (38) and `ccBGSSSE008_Boss` 000821:ccbgssse008-wraithguard.esl (36) are Dwarven Centurions with no template; both are on *Automatons*. The Messenger (`ccBGSSSE008_CenturionBoss`) is on *Unique Automatons*.",
      "Every other centurion record (`EncDwarvenCenturion01Ambush` · `02Ambush` · `03Ambush`, `dunShimmermistCenturion`, `dunIrkngthandEncDwarvenCenturionAmbush`, `DLC2dunNchardakCenturionBoss`, `DLC2dunNchardakWorkshopEndCenturion`, `DLC2KagrumezLvlDwarvenCenturionFight3`, `TreasCorpseDwarvenCenturion` and every `Lvl*` wrapper) carries `Stats` and follows its template or list."
